{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>2026</span>香港小姐競選決賽》昨日（<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>30</span>）圓滿結束，<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>8</span>號鄧匡閔奪亞軍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午2.53.06.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026qyZRhzKxaU1788165403.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午2.53.06.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">完成賽事後亞軍得主鄧匡閔接受<span style=\"color: rgb(220, 161, 13);\">tvb.com</span>獨家訪問坦言心情平靜，「我成晚完全唔緊張，以為自己緊張到腳震，但一企喺個舞台就好享受，成晚個狀態都好放鬆。」</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>她自爆有好有蝦碌事情發生「好似踩到條裙、頭髮亂咗同禮花跌咗落身上，我都好淡定解決咗。」</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"PingFang HK\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>談到她最想感謝的人，鄧匡閔說：「我嘅父母，因為我爸爸做我司機日日車我返工放工，我媽咪每日都會準備飯盒畀我食健康餐，感謝佢哋嘅愛錫。」又現時最想吃東西和睡覺，好好放鬆。</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"PingFang HK\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"batch_FR6D6997.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026hGFk4nGZvW1788165402.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_FR6D6997.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T08:59:49.957020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}